slate-700/50 shadow-none hover:shadow-none group-hover/list:opacity-40 group-hover/list:bg-white/50 dark:group-hover/list:bg-slate-800/40 hover:!opacity-100 hover:!bg-white dark:hover:!bg-slate-800\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] dark:text-slate-100 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors\">\n        토스 앱에 오픈하는 내 서비스\n      </span>\n      <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-transparent group-hover/item:bg-slate-100/80 dark:group-hover/item:bg-slate-700/80 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 group-hover/list:text-slate-400 group-hover/item:text-[#333d4b] dark:group-hover/item:text-white transition-all shrink-0 ml-3 shadow-none\">\n        <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group/item bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/90 rounded-full py-3.5 sm:py-4 px-5 sm:px-6 flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer border border-white/50 dark:border-slate-700/50 shadow-none hover:shadow-none group-hover/list:opacity-40 group-hover/list:bg-white/50 dark:group-hover/list:bg-slate-800/40 hover:!opacity-100 hover:!bg-white dark:hover:!bg-slate-800\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] dark:text-slate-100 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors\">\n        사장님의 경영을 돕는 결제 단말기\n      </span>\n      <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-transparent group-hover/item:bg-slate-100/80 dark:group-hover/item:bg-slate-700/80 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 group-hover/list:text-slate-400 group-hover/item:text-[#333d4b] dark:group-hover/item:text-white transition-all shrink-0 ml-3 shadow-none\">\n        <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group/item bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/90 rounded-full py-3.5 sm:py-4 px-5 sm:px-6 flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer border border-white/50 dark:border-slate-700/50 shadow-none hover:shadow-none group-hover/list:opacity-40 group-hover/list:bg-white/50 dark:group-hover/list:bg-slate-800/40 hover:!opacity-100 hover:!bg-white dark:hover:!bg-slate-800\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] dark:text-slate-100 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors\">\n        온라인 사업에 필요한 결제 솔루션\n      </span>\n      <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-transparent group-hover/item:bg-slate-100/80 dark:group-hover/item:bg-slate-700/80 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 group-hover/list:text-slate-400 group-hover/item:text-[#333d4b] dark:group-hover/item:text-white transition-all shrink-0 ml-3 shadow-none\">\n        <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group/item bg-white dark:bg-slate-800/90 rounded-full py-3.5 sm:py-4 px-5 sm:px-6 flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer border border-white/50 dark:border-slate-700/50 shadow-none hover:shadow-none group-hover/list:opacity-40 group-hover/list:bg-white/50 dark:group-hover/list:bg-slate-800/40 hover:!opacity-100 hover:!bg-white dark:hover:!bg-slate-800\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] dark:text-slate-100 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors\">\n        셀러와 사용자를 잇는 토스 쇼핑\n      </span>\n      <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-transparent group-hover/item:bg-slate-100/80 dark:group-hover/item:bg-slate-700/80 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 group-hover/list:text-slate-400 group-hover/item:text-[#333d4b] dark:group-hover/item:text-white transition-all shrink-0 ml-3 shadow-none\">\n        <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\" />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
